     \]

2. **Acceleration of the Center of Physics (\( \alpha = a \))**:
   - The velocity of the center of the sphere is \( v_1 = v_0 + at \).
   - The angular velocity \( \omega \) is related to the vertical speed by \( v_1 = \omega R \).
   - The angular acceleration \( \alpha \) is \( \alpha = \frac{d\omega}{dt} \).

