\[
P_{3}(x) = \frac{1}{3!} \frac{d^{3}}{dx^{3}} (1 - x^{2})^{3}
\]

First, compute the second derivative:
\[
\frac{d}{dx} (1 - 3x^{2} + 3x^{4} - x^{6}) = -6x + 12x^{3} - 6x^{5}
