- Equalibrom Mo-CH3COOH = 0.333 gram-mo
- Equibrom Mo-C2H5O H = Initial Mo - Mo consumed = 1 - 0.667 = 0.333 gram-mo
- Equibrom Mo-Ch3Coo C2H5 = Mo produced = 0.667 gram-mo
- Equibrom Mo-H2O = Mo produced = 0.667 gram-mo

The expression for the equalibrom constant K is:

K = [Ch3Coo C2H5] [H2O] / [Ch3Cooh][C2H5O H]

